  m_Name: Hint_Step17_FolderPermissions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Hint
    text: "Same property sheet, the Security tab \u2014 Sharing puts the folder on
      the network, Security decides who may do what with it."
  - speakerName: Hint
    text: 'Edit..., select STUDENTS, and grant Modify. Not Full control: that also
      lets the group change these permissions and take ownership.'
